concept:australian-civilian-corps-amendment-act-2013-sec-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3 Schedule(s)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-3 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Each Act, and each set of regulations or directions, that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule concerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect according to its terms.  (2) The amendment of any regulation under subsection (1) does not prevent the regulation, as so amended, from being amended or repealed by the Governor-General.  (3) The amendment of any direction under subsection (1) does not prevent the direction, as so amended, from being amended or repealed by the Prime Minister or the Secretary of the Department (as the case requires). ComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00140  Amendments  Schedule 1 Amendment of the Australian Civilian Corps Act 2011  Part 1  No. 140, 2013 Australian Civilian Corps Amendment Act 2013" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Each Act, and each set of regulations or directions, that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule concerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect according to its terms.  (2) The amendment of any regulation under subsection (1) does not prevent the regulation, as so amended, from being amended or repealed by the Governor-General.  (3) The amendment of any direction under subsection (1) does not prevent the direction, as so amended, from being amended or repealed by the Prime Minister or the Secretary of the Department (as the case requires). ComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00140  Amendments  Schedule 1 Amendment of the Australian Civilian Corps Act 2011  Part 1  No. 140, 2013 Australian Civilian Corps Amendment Act 2013"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a9e175300db737ee9dc5359689ec08180ba2e16b693b1080435c9e979eb890ab" ;
    cof:pageNumber "6"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-civilian-corps-amendment-act-2013-sec-3-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-civilian-corps-amendment-act-2013-sec-3-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-civilian-corps-amendment-act-2013-sec-3-ss-3 ;
